OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Flargely dry overnight with an
OL,7,Fincreasing southeasterly wind. Chance
OL,8,Fof the odd spot of rain arriving into
OL,9,Fthe far north by dawn. Cold with a
OL,10,Fpatchy frost developing. Wind light
OL,11,Fbut breezy along the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA chilly and dull day with
OL,14,Fstrong winds and occasional rain that
OL,15,Fmay initially fall as freezing rain
OL,16,Fover the hills. Cold and cloudy
OL,17,Fovernight with further spells of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
