OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of heavy rain on
OL,7,FSaturday. Becoming brighter by Sunday
OL,8,Fwith afternoon showers to follow.
OL,9,FCloudy with a chance of rain on Monday
OL,10,Fand a strengthening wind.
